1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,980
Episode 58
Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 5

2
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:07,750
Domain Expansion:

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,780
Chimera Shadow Garden.

4
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:18,870
Esoteric Technique: Hollow Wicker Basket!

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:26,840
Hollow Wicker Basket is the origin of
New Shadow Style's "Simple Domain."

6
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,970
It possesses the ability
to neutralize a domain

7
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:32,490
and counter its guaranteed-hit factor.

8
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:34,480
Too bad!

9
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:38,790
The "Domain Amplification" used
by Jogo and Hanami in Shibuya

10
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,720
utilized a domain capable of harboring

11
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:43,260
a guaranteed-hit,
guaranteed-kill technique...

12
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:47,860
Why is it hitting me?!

13
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:51,160
...and intentionally left out
their cursed techniques

14
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:55,070
to leave space for Gojo's
cursed technique to flow into,

15
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:57,160
neutralizing his Limitless.

16
00:00:57,440 --> 00:01:00,080
However, Hollow Wicker
Basket and Simple Domain

17
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,500
aren't capable of neutralizing
the cursed technique.

18
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:07,890
They work by neutralizing a barrier
imbued with a cursed technique

19
00:01:07,890 --> 00:01:12,340
to nullify the imbued technique's
guaranteed-hit effect.

20
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:18,400
However, Fushiguro's
domain is incomplete.

21
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,500
You're not sneering anymore.

22
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,270
Damn brat!

23
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:29,410
By transposing his domain onto
the space of the gymnasium,

24
00:01:29,410 --> 00:01:31,750
he managed to force it to close,

25
00:01:31,750 --> 00:01:34,610
but it's not imbued with a
guaranteed-hit technique.

26
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,190
Don't act like you've won!

27
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:41,090
Now I see.

28
00:01:41,090 --> 00:01:42,950
Chimera Shadow Garden

29
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:47,170
currently just extends his
Ten Shadows Technique,

30
00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:52,070
and draws out 120% of
his latent potential.

31
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:54,960
However, that very imperfection

32
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:57,550
is what caught Reggie Star off-guard.

33
00:01:57,550 --> 00:02:02,130
Both his clones and his shikigami had
physical forms before striking me.

34
00:02:02,130 --> 00:02:03,660
That means this barrier

35
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:06,140
isn't imbued with a
guaranteed-hit technique!

36
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:10,620
The domain's buff to his technique's
abilities is no joke, though.

37
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:14,000
This is even worse to deal with than
a simple guaranteed-hit domain!

38
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,830
If he pulls out that elephant
here and drenches me in water,

39
00:02:17,830 --> 00:02:20,960
it'll halve my options,
and I'll probably lose.

40
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:29,950
But...

41
00:02:29,950 --> 00:02:32,150
it's so like me

42
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:35,010
to make sure that won't happen.

43
00:02:35,970 --> 00:02:37,010
Nue!

44
00:02:41,810 --> 00:02:43,370
Too slow!

45
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:48,780
I knew it.

46
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:53,300
For a while now,

47
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:57,320
I've had to reinforce my footing with
cursed energy to avoid getting sucked in.

48
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:05,280
The whole bottom of this domain
is your shadow, right?

49
00:03:05,290 --> 00:03:10,440
Being able to store and remove yourself
and objects is convenient, isn't it?

50
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:13,180
But one thing nagged at me.

51
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:15,690
"He doesn't have many weapons."

52
00:03:15,690 --> 00:03:19,010
I've only seen you use
one paltry cursed tool.

53
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:20,650
Either it has a low capacity

54
00:03:20,650 --> 00:03:25,230
and you need to reserve space
for yourself at all times,

55
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:31,730
or you're forced to bear the weight of
things stored in your shadow yourself.

56
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:35,480
Looks like the latter was spot-on!

57
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:39,490
Now I've turned the design
of your domain against you.

58
00:03:39,490 --> 00:03:44,410
With three passenger cars,
your current weight is 2.4 tons.

59
00:03:44,810 --> 00:03:47,210
Looks like your clones weren't
able to tolerate it,

60
00:03:47,210 --> 00:03:50,420
but can you still produce your shikigami?

61
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:54,450
Either way, I'll just
need to mind my footing

62
00:03:54,450 --> 00:03:58,960
as I keep adding weight until
you're crushed under it.

63
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:03,750
Are you stupid?

64
00:04:03,750 --> 00:04:05,150
Huh?

65
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:08,700
Even if it's incomplete,
a domain is still a domain!

66
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:12,940
My shadow's above us, too!

67
00:04:24,740 --> 00:04:27,190
Which of us will get crushed first,

68
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,260
Reggie?!

69
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,200
JUJUTSU KAISEN

70
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:08,720
JUJUTSU KAISEN
The Culling Game Part 1

71
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:09,170
It's said that a typical human will
lose consciousness at five to six Gs.

72
00:06:09,830 --> 00:06:11,570
2.4 tons.

73
00:06:12,170 --> 00:06:15,320
As Fushiguro weighed 60 kilograms,

74
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:19,470
that meant he was currently
suffering 40 Gs.

75
00:06:20,260 --> 00:06:24,080
In order to prevent his blood from
pooling in his legs from the high Gs

76
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:27,200
and depriving his brain of blood flow,

77
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:29,640
Fushiguro was lowering his posture

78
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:31,920
and reinforcing his body
with cursed energy,

79
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:34,780
paying special attention to his legs.

80
00:06:36,060 --> 00:06:40,530
A mature African elephant
weighs three to six tons.

81
00:06:41,930 --> 00:06:45,210
With the domain's improvement
to his technique's accuracy,

82
00:06:45,210 --> 00:06:48,590
Max Elephant accurately
recreated its real weight.

83
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:54,820
Under that weight, Reggie Star's right
fibula and heel bone were cracked.

84
00:06:56,030 --> 00:06:58,760
Both of them faced

85
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:02,620
the possibility of being crushed
to death at any second.

86
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:06,000
I screwed up!

87
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,840
I could have won if I'd kept
the trucks in reserve!

88
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,330
What do I do?

89
00:07:10,330 --> 00:07:13,060
I got splashed with some
water at the same time,

90
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:15,000
but my trump card's still safe.

91
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:19,040
I could slip into his shadow and
recreate my trump card inside it.

92
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:21,440
That would crush him!

93
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:24,430
No...

94
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:26,820
If he's not dismissing his domain,

95
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:32,380
that means anything in his shadow is
stuck there after he dismisses his domain!

96
00:07:32,830 --> 00:07:36,930
What if I'm stuck in his shadow
forever after he dies?

97
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:40,070
What's it like inside his shadow, anyway?

98
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:43,040
It looks like a liquid,
but can I breathe in it?

99
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,060
Can I float?

100
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:48,560
No. Submerging into his
shadow is too risky.

101
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:51,370
So while stuck in this state...

102
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:55,550
I have to pull out my trump
card and activate it!

103
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:02,620
Contractual Re-Creation!

104
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:05,250
Snap

105
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,110
I didn't make it in time!

106
00:08:24,110 --> 00:08:27,260
And there's no air inside his shadow!

107
00:08:28,710 --> 00:08:31,540
No buoyancy or resistance, either!

108
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:38,900
I'm just... sinking!

109
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:43,790
My consciousness... is fading...

110
00:08:49,490 --> 00:08:51,850
Not yet! Endure it a little longer!

111
00:08:51,850 --> 00:08:54,720
Wait until I'm sure he's dead
before dismissing the domain!

112
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:57,600
Then I can expel what's in my shadow!

113
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:32,710
The things I recreate

114
00:09:32,710 --> 00:09:36,920
disappear soon after carrying
out the command I give them.

115
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:40,180
I hadn't given the cars
I sank a command, though.

116
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:43,430
I didn't want them
disappearing, after all.

117
00:09:43,430 --> 00:09:46,510
That meant I could still
issue them a command.

118
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:49,330
"Take me and rise up!"

119
00:09:49,330 --> 00:09:53,900
The weight of one car is gone
now, but that saved my life.

120
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,500
I'll admit it.

121
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:01,440
You're strong.

122
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:07,270
But I'm stronger!

123
00:10:07,270 --> 00:10:10,790
Contractual Re-Creation!

124
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:21,340
A 132-square-foot,
two-story wooden frame structure!

125
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:24,770
The framework alone weighs
at least thirty tons!

126
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:27,610
Get crushed!

127
00:11:00,470 --> 00:11:02,240
What happened?!

128
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:04,810
Did I fall into his shadow again?

129
00:11:06,090 --> 00:11:07,500
No!

130
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:09,160
I'm in actual water!

131
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,150
How?!

132
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:12,320
It's heavy!

133
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:15,110
Is that brat trying to strangle me?

134
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,310
What power!

135
00:11:17,310 --> 00:11:19,050
No, that's wrong!

136
00:11:19,050 --> 00:11:22,420
It's from the weight of
the two cars I added!

137
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,730
This is bad!

138
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:28,060
This time, I'm sinking!

139
00:11:28,690 --> 00:11:31,960
I have to dismiss
Contractual Re-Creation!

140
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:51,760
Right!

141
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,760
This is a community gymnasium!

142
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:56,970
And the gymnasium's basement
is a heated swimming pool!

143
00:11:59,790 --> 00:12:02,570
Did he flee into his shadow
and dismiss his domain,

144
00:12:02,570 --> 00:12:06,310
forcing me to destroy the floor
and plunge into the pool?

145
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:13,080
You can't use your receipts when
they're that soaked, can you?

146
00:12:17,190 --> 00:12:20,590
He waited instead of
pursuing me immediately.

147
00:12:20,590 --> 00:12:24,010
He let his technique recover after
exhausting it with his domain, then?

148
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:27,980
Are you sure about that?

149
00:12:28,740 --> 00:12:32,470
I'm betting you can't produce
shikigami anymore either, right?

150
00:12:33,650 --> 00:12:35,160
That's true.

151
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:38,140
You do understand what
comes next, don't you?

152
00:12:39,650 --> 00:12:43,260
He'll use a shikigami other than that dog.

153
00:12:43,260 --> 00:12:45,540
But none of them can
deal a decisive blow.

154
00:12:45,540 --> 00:12:47,350
So use it!

155
00:12:47,350 --> 00:12:51,160
The moment you let up,
I'll finish you with a counter!

156
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:46,370
Demon Dogs isn't weak enough
to let that stop it.

157
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:52,010
Sorcerers are all liars, huh?

158
00:13:52,230 --> 00:13:55,010
JUJUTSU KAISEN

159
00:13:57,690 --> 00:14:00,030
JUJUTSU KAISEN

160
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:09,970
The domain,

161
00:14:09,970 --> 00:14:11,180
the pool...

162
00:14:11,830 --> 00:14:16,380
All to convince me you couldn't
use that dog anymore.

163
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:20,160
You didn't flee into this gymnasium.

164
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,800
You lured me into it.

165
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,450
To think I'd let a modern sorcerer,

166
00:14:24,450 --> 00:14:28,340
and a brat at that, get the better of me.

167
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,830
Even if I wanted to flee, Nue can't
fly with someone for very long.

168
00:14:33,830 --> 00:14:36,100
I've struggled with that before.

169
00:14:41,820 --> 00:14:45,710
What's your relation to Tengen-sama?

170
00:14:49,610 --> 00:14:51,430
Tengen?

171
00:14:52,450 --> 00:14:55,080
Oh, right.

172
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:57,370
They would still be alive, huh?

173
00:14:58,070 --> 00:15:00,350
That shut-in.

174
00:15:00,350 --> 00:15:02,340
Yeah? That's enough.

175
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:08,340
Reggie said Tengen-sama's claims about
the Culling Game's goals were a bluff.

176
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:12,340
I should probably consider
the possibility that

177
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:16,330
Tengen-sama and Kenjaku are secretly
connected and lied about their goal,

178
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,240
but that doesn't seem
likely from his reaction.

179
00:15:23,410 --> 00:15:28,880
Kogane, give him all my points.

180
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,580
Okay!

181
00:15:32,030 --> 00:15:36,340
You have received
41 points from Reggie Star.

182
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:37,820
What are you plotting?

183
00:15:38,550 --> 00:15:41,460
That's an awful thing to say.

184
00:15:41,460 --> 00:15:44,270
It's my good deed before I die.

185
00:15:44,970 --> 00:15:47,700
I'm just a spectator.

186
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:50,350
I was never close friends with Kenjaku.

187
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:54,430
I think doing this will
make things interesting.

188
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:56,820
That's my intuition.

189
00:15:58,280 --> 00:16:00,190
Please.

190
00:16:00,190 --> 00:16:02,660
You did kill me, after all.

191
00:16:03,310 --> 00:16:10,310
Let fate toy with you
a bit, and die a fool.

192
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,790
You have gained five points.

193
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:50,180
Did I get him?!

194
00:16:50,710 --> 00:16:52,890
No! Don't let your guard down!

195
00:16:54,430 --> 00:16:55,820
He's tough!

196
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:57,410
What the hell?!

197
00:16:56,410 --> 00:16:57,410
Slide

198
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,990
Why are you covered in lotion?!

199
00:16:59,990 --> 00:17:01,450
It could be sauce.

200
00:17:01,450 --> 00:17:02,920
Shut up! Die!

201
00:17:04,470 --> 00:17:07,120
Wait, it really is sauce?!

202
00:17:07,390 --> 00:17:08,190
Damn it!

203
00:17:08,190 --> 00:17:10,110
Seriously, what's with this guy?!

204
00:17:10,110 --> 00:17:12,240
I've blown him up several times!

205
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:14,440
I feel like I've killed him five times!

206
00:17:14,830 --> 00:17:17,410
So how does he have so little damage?!

207
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:18,680
So little.

208
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:20,010
You hate sauce?

209
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:23,240
His first injury healed
at some point, too.

210
00:17:23,740 --> 00:17:27,720
But he hasn't shown any signs of using
reverse cursed techniques like I do.

211
00:17:28,350 --> 00:17:30,470
I don't get it!

212
00:17:31,030 --> 00:17:32,520
Hazenoki-sama.

213
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:33,830
What?

214
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:36,990
Reggie Star-sama has just died.

215
00:17:40,670 --> 00:17:42,220
Oh? What happened?

216
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:43,550
I'm going home.

217
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:44,920
I'm sick of this.

218
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,010
Okay!

219
00:17:46,010 --> 00:17:47,140
Take a bath!

220
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:48,460
And brush your teeth!

221
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:54,000
Hey, man! Give me your points!

222
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,670
Stop following me.

223
00:17:55,670 --> 00:17:59,360
Please! Just think of it
as going with the flow!

224
00:17:59,360 --> 00:18:00,350
Die.

225
00:18:00,660 --> 00:18:03,380
Takaba's cursed technique, Comedian,

226
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:07,760
makes whatever he's convinced
would be funny a reality.

227
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:11,860
It's a technique capable of
opposing even Satoru Gojo.

228
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:18,370
Yet Takaba doesn't know anything
about his own technique.

229
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:28,820
I don't get it! I don't get it!

230
00:18:28,820 --> 00:18:32,250
Ever since I became an adult,
I hardly understand anything!

231
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:40,750
I've heard that all men are wolves,

232
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:44,930
but it's always those wolves who take
care of the confusing stuff for me!

233
00:18:49,170 --> 00:18:51,810
If those wolves will handle everything,

234
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:54,670
then I don't need to
think about anything!

235
00:18:54,670 --> 00:18:57,360
Because I'm so cute!

236
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:07,650
Those wolves always... always...

237
00:19:16,290 --> 00:19:18,730
Don't, Megumi.

238
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:27,150
You'll spare me?

239
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:37,140
Shut up.

240
00:19:40,460 --> 00:19:42,450
Damn sister.

241
00:20:01,990 --> 00:20:05,070
Events progressed quickly
in the Sendai Colony,

242
00:20:02,220 --> 00:20:06,930
Sendai City, Miyagi Prefecture, November 12th, 11:28

243
00:20:05,070 --> 00:20:08,710
far outstripping those
of the Tokyo Colony

244
00:20:08,710 --> 00:20:10,420
and becoming especially fierce.

245
00:20:12,660 --> 00:20:17,270
Dhruv Lakdawalla. Current points: 91.

246
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:19,070
This is his second incarnation.

247
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:22,510
He's an old man who
single-handedly conquered

248
00:20:22,510 --> 00:20:25,270
this archipelago during
the Civil War of Wa.

249
00:20:25,870 --> 00:20:28,340
He possesses two autonomous shikigami,

250
00:20:28,340 --> 00:20:32,570
and the orbit of those shikigami
determines his domain.

251
00:20:35,510 --> 00:20:40,030
Ryu Ishigori. Current points: 77.

252
00:20:40,710 --> 00:20:45,130
He's the cannon with the greatest
cursed energy output among the Players.

253
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:50,430
Takako Uro. Current points: 70.

254
00:20:51,130 --> 00:20:54,120
She was originally the captain of
the Sun, Moon, and Stars Squad,

255
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:56,730
a squad of assassins serving
directly under the Fujiwara Clan.

256
00:20:57,260 --> 00:21:00,520
She possesses a technique that
allows her to manipulate "the sky."

257
00:21:01,740 --> 00:21:06,020
Kurourushi. Current points: 54.

258
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:08,860
It's a cockroach cursed
spirit that Kenjaku freed

259
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:12,020
from the control of cursed
spirit manipulation.

260
00:21:12,020 --> 00:21:15,880
It ranks as a special-grade
(already registered).

261
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:20,840
It's currently lying dormant until
certain conditions are met.

262
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:23,790
There was no alliance between them,

263
00:21:23,790 --> 00:21:27,590
but their complex compatibility
and opposing strength

264
00:21:27,590 --> 00:21:30,050
led them into a three—no,
a four-way stalemate.

265
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:33,340
But one of those pillars

266
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:36,160
has fallen.

267
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:42,390
Yuta Okkotsu. Current points: 35.

268
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:45,480
Three months after the
Night Parade of a Hundred Demons,

269
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:47,980
he had blossomed as a
special-grade sorcerer.

270
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:51,530
He was a modern sorcerer
rivaling Satoru Gojo

271
00:21:51,530 --> 00:21:53,070
in unusual abilities.

272
00:23:26,550 --> 00:23:28,400
I'll obtain 400 points on my own.

273
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:31,080
Yuta, which would you like?

274
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:32,310
It's called Kurourushi!

275
00:23:32,310 --> 00:23:32,810
Give me everything.

276
00:23:32,810 --> 00:23:35,340
Give me back Yuta!

277
00:23:35,340 --> 00:23:38,430
Sensei, I won't let you kill
your best friend twice.

278
00:23:36,970 --> 00:23:39,980
Next Episode
Sendai Colony
